  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Only the header is sent",
      "items": [
        "A façade sends the project as the x-project-id header or not at all.",
        "It never sends the deprecated projectId query parameter or project-id body field: Lakekeeper lets those win over the header."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Deprecated body field",
      "items": [
        "Alone, the body project-id acts like WithProject.",
        "Equal to WithProject, it is dropped.",
        "Different from WithProject, the call fails with ErrProjectIDConflict.",
        "The caller's request model is not modified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Rejected before sending",
      "items": [
        "WithProject(\"\") fails with ErrEmptyProjectID, so an unset variable can't target the default project.",
        "Projects.Delete and Permissions.Projects Grant and Revoke fail with ErrProjectRequired without WithProject."
      ]
    }
  ]
